# Build-time configuration for this Site's Vercel project. Copy to .env.local
# for a local build; never commit a filled-in copy.

# The Tenant whose Content this Site serves. Required whenever
# FIREBASE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT is set — a Site that can reach Firestore and has not
# been told whose Content to read fails the build rather than guessing, because
# a guess would publish another Tenant's words. With neither variable set the
# Site builds and every Section renders its empty state.
TENANT_ID=demo-salon

# A Firebase service account JSON, base64-encoded into one line. Base64 because
# the private key is a PEM whose newlines do not survive a dashboard field, a
# shell or an env file intact. Generate with:
#   base64 -i service-account.json | tr -d '\n'
FIREBASE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT=
